<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Aspect estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Aspect estimate raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it raised its earnings estimate for Aspect Development Corp to $0.38 a share from $0.36, while maintaining its 1998 estimate of $0.59.</p>
<p>-- The rating remains outperform.</p>
<p>-- The revision in earnings follows first quarter earnings of $0.07 a share, $0.02 above Everen's estimate.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
